    ],
    "searchCoverage": "Official Cloud API uses HTTP Basic Auth (API key username + API secret password) against https://console.cratedb.cloud. GET /api/v2/users/me is the documented account probe and pinned credential validator. GET /api/v2/organizations/, /projects/, /clusters/, and /regions/ are documented reads. Organization-scoped computed paths are omitted. Operator is Crate.io, Inc. (Redwood City) with EU affiliates. 2023-12-21 X-Real-IP advisory was remediations-posted with no evidence of exploitation. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no unresolved CrateDB Cloud compromise. Bounded coverage is not a breach-free claim.",
    "incidents": [
      {
        "date": "2023-12-21",
        "subject": "CrateDB authentication advisory for HTTP X-Real-IP trust",
        "finding": "CrateDB disclosed a reported authentication vulnerability that could potentially affect users if HTTP X-Real-IP was trusted. The team posted mitigations (disable trust of X-Real-IP by default) and stated it had no evidence the issue was exploited or data inappropriately disclosed.",
        "remediation": "Default disabled X-Real-IP trust (crate/crate#15234). Customers were asked to apply recommended mitigations.",
        "limitation": "Historical self-hosted/engine advisory; not an unresolved CrateDB Cloud platform compromise. Bounded public-source review as of 2026-09-13."
      }
    ],
    "remainingGates": [
      "live authentication unverified"
    ],
    "waiverAuthority": "User waiver dated 2026-09-13 permits historical non-China incident coverage."
  },
